<title>UK: Iran buys cargo of April/May white sugar - traders.</title>
<headline>Iran buys cargo of April/May white sugar - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran bought a cargo of white sugar for April/May shipment earlier this week, London sugar traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>But details of the price paid and the supplier have yet to emerge, they added.</p>
<p>Last week Iran was reported to have bought another cargo of April white sugar at $314.00 per tonne from a leading London trade house.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
